{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57227","headline":"谶 十六 · 菩提达摩","name":"谶 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"说小何曾小（《天圣广灯录》作「说少何曾少」，希字是也）言流又不流。\n（迁字是也）草若除其首，（石头无草）三四继门修。\n（传法弟子人数，准其传法人数，应云十七继门修也。\n○以上十七首，均见《祖堂集》卷二。\n《五灯会元》卷一录其一、其二、其四三首。\n《古尊宿语录》卷一引二首）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"菩提达摩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57227.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57227","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}